1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:13,320
How did Sam get his money back?
萨姆是怎么把钱要回来的？

2
00:00:13,320 --> 00:00:15,750
How did Sam get his money back?
萨姆是怎么把钱要回来的？

3
00:00:18,250 --> 00:00:23,660
The whole village soon learnt that a large sum of money had been lost.
整个村子很快就知道有一大笔钱丢了。

4
00:00:25,210 --> 00:00:27,560
Sam Benton, the local butcher,
当地的肉店老板萨姆·本顿，

5
00:00:27,910 --> 00:00:32,700
had lost his wallet while taking his savings to the post office.
在把存款送往邮局的路上丢了钱包。

6
00:00:33,030 --> 00:00:38,760
Sam was sure that the wallet must have been found by one of the villagers,
萨姆确信钱包一定是被某个村民捡到了，

7
00:00:39,140 --> 00:00:41,650
but it was not returned to him.
但却没有还给他。

8
00:00:43,390 --> 00:00:46,620
Three months passed, and then one morning,
三个月过去了，后来一天早晨，

9
00:00:46,640 --> 00:00:50,880
Sam found his wallet outside his front door.
萨姆在自己家大门外发现了钱包。

10
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:55,670
It had been wrapped up in newspaper and
钱包是用报纸包着的，

11
00:00:55,690 --> 00:00:58,310
it contained half the money he had lost,
里面装着他丢失的一半钱，

12
00:00:59,020 --> 00:01:01,410
together with a note which said:
还附有一张纸条，上面写着：

13
00:01:02,580 --> 00:01:07,130
'A thief, yes, but only 50 per cent a thief!'
“是个贼，不错，但只是50%的贼！”

14
00:01:09,660 --> 00:01:11,070
Two months later,
两个月以后，

15
00:01:11,420 --> 00:01:15,230
some more money was sent to Sam with another note:
又有人给萨姆送来一些钱，还附了一张纸条：

16
00:01:17,250 --> 00:01:22,020
'Only 25 per cent a thief now!'
“现在只是25%的贼了！”

17
00:01:22,040 --> 00:01:26,180
In time, all Sam's money was paid back in this way.
终于，萨姆所有的钱都以这种方式还了回来。

18
00:01:27,270 --> 00:01:33,190
The last note said: 'I am 100 per cent honest now!'
最后一张纸条上写着：“我现在是100%的诚实人了！”
